# Packaged exercise media (~80 MB: 1324 MP4 animations + 1324 WebP stills). Not
# committed: it is generated from the upstream dataset by tools/fetch_gym_media.sh +
# tools/convert_gym_media_v3.py, so committing it would put 80 MB in every clone to no
# benefit. Run tools/validate_media.py on the result before installing it, and the built
# APK on the Releases page already contains it.
frontend/public/gif/
frontend/public/img/
